  "description": "MCP (Model Context Protocol) client for ABP apps on the official ModelContextProtocol SDK: MCP tools as Microsoft.Extensions.AI AIFunctions with namespaced names, shared sessions per tenant and connection (ref count, retire then dispose, secret-free fingerprint, bounded reconnect on an expired session), a tool catalog cache with a TTL invalidated by tools/list_changed, https-only HTTP transports through the EraTech.Http.Safe SSRF guard, stdio off by default with a command allow-list and no shell, per-connection tool allow-lists, secrets resolved at call time and never logged, timeouts. Stores nothing.",
